- Serum 25‑hydroxyvitamin D  
- Serum calcium and basic metabolic panel (to check calcium/renal function)  
- Parathyroid hormone (PTH) if calcium abnormalities or strong suspicion of primary hyperparathyroidism  
- TSH (thyroid disease can affect bone)  
- CBC and possibly serum protein electrophoresis if unexplained bone loss is suspected  
- Vitamin B12 (metformin can lower B12 — neuropathy/falls risk)  
