- “I’m preparing for my annual physical and would like evaluation for bone health. My relevant history: age 55, atrial fibrillation, on [anticoagulant name?], metformin 500 mg BID, history of retinopathy, taking calcium and vitamin D. My last INR was 1.2. Could we:
